onsive dashboard as a favorite":[163,185],"#Manage responsive dashboards#Mark a responsive dashboard as a favorite#{1}":[165,166],"#Manage responsive dashboards#Mark a responsive dashboard as a favorite#Before you begin":[167,172],"#Manage responsive dashboards#Mark a responsive dashboard as a favorite#Before you begin#{1}":[169,172],"#Manage responsive dashboards#Mark a responsive dashboard as a favorite#Procedure":[173,181],"#Manage responsive dashboards#Mark a responsive dashboard as a favorite#Procedure#{1}":[175,176],"#Manage responsive dashboards#Mark a responsive dashboard as a favorite#Procedure#{2}":[177,178],"#Manage responsive dashboards#Mark a responsive dashboard as a favorite#Procedure#{3}":[179,181],"#Manage responsive dashboards#Mark a responsive dashboard as a favorite#Result":[182,185],"#Manage responsive dashboards#Mark a responsive dashboard as a favorite#Result#{1}":[184,185],"#Manage responsive dashboards#Related":[186,191],"#Manage responsive dashboards#Related#{1}":[188,188],"#Manage responsive dashboards#Related#{2}":[189,189],"#Manage responsive dashboards#Related#{3}":[190,191]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Delete a Platform Analytics dashboard","target":"delete-db-in-ac","line":37},{"title":"Platform Analytics experience","target":"par-workspace","line":37},{"title":"Duplicate a Platform Analytics dashboard","target":"duplicate-db","line":79},{"title":"Dashboard permissions","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/performance-analytics/c_DashboardRoles.md","line":110},{"title":"Dashboard permissions","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/performance-analytics/c_DashboardRoles.md","line":139},{"title":"Restrict responsive dashboard access to specific roles","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/performance-analytics/restrict-dashboard-access-to-certain-roles.md","line":161},{"title":"Delete a Platform Analytics dashboard","target":"delete-db-in-ac","line":188},{"title":"Duplicate a Platform Analytics dashboard","target":"duplicate-db","line":189},{"title":"Platform Analytics experience","target":"par-workspace","line":190}],"metadata":{"title":"Manage responsive dashboards","description":"Depending upon their role, users can delete or duplicate responsive dashboards, and remove a user from a dashboard. All users can mark a dashboard as a favorite.Delete dashboards that are no longer used. Deleted dashboards cannot be restored.When dashboard tabs are no longer useful, it is possible to delete them.When you duplicate a responsive dashboard, its widget layout is preserved. However, sharing permissions aren’t preserved. Changes you make to the duplicated dashboard don’t affect the original dashboard.Provide a more useful name for your dashboard by renaming it.When you no longer want to share a dashboard with specific users, groups, or roles, you can remove their access to the dashboard.You can mark a dashboard as a favorite to access it easily from the navigation pane.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/now-intelligence/performance-analytics/manage-responsive-dashboards.html","release":"australia","product":"Performance Analytics","classification":"performance-analytics","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":5,"keywords":["dashboard","delete a dashboard","how to clone a dashboard","duplicate a dashboard","copy a dashboard","set a dashboard favorite","bookmark a dashboard","favorite a dashboard"],"breadcrumb":["Working with responsive dashboards","Create and use dashboards","Responsive dashboards in the Core UI","Reporting","dashboards","and Performance Analytics in the Core UI","Platform Analytics"],"tags":["#now-intelligence","#pa","#scorecards","#indicators","#analytics","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/now-intelligence/performance-analytics/manage-responsive-dashboards.md"},
